<title>JAPAN: Cowboy - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Cowboy - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 46.75		vs	   41.71</p>
<p> Operating	  393    million    vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Current	    234    million    vs	    1.06</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.20		vs	prft 407 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 78.51 yen	  vs    prft 29.38 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Cowboy Co Ltd is a discount store specialising in fresh foods.</p>
</text>
